Thought: I need to retrieve all data for products classified under ‘ZZ’, including their Revenue, Initial Inventory, and Demand. I will use these to define the objective and constraints. The decision variables x_i are the number of units of each ‘ZZ’ product to fulfill, which must be nonnegative integers, bounded above by both initial inventory and demand.

